    "7-aminoclonazepam has no meaningful activity at GABA-A — it's an inactive metabolite used as a urinary marker for clonazepam exposure, not a contributor to the drug's effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "7-氨基氯硝西泮在 GABA-A 上无显著活性——它是一种无活性代谢物，用作氯硝西泮暴露的尿液标志物，不参与药物效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "7-胺基氯硝西泮在 GABA-A 上無顯著活性——它是一種無活性代謝物，用作氯硝西泮暴露的尿液標誌物，不參與藥物效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
