            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "988 自殺與危機生命線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A benzodiazepine amount in diazepam, per Ashton" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按 Ashton 换算成地西泮的苯二氮䓬用量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依 Ashton 換算成地西泮的苯二氮平類用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A benzodiazepine amount in milligrams of diazepam, from the Ashton Manual's table." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取自 Ashton 手册表格的苯二氮䓬用量，以地西泮的毫克数表示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取自 Ashton 手冊表格的苯二氮平類用量，以地西泮的毫克數表示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A binding-affinity measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是受体结合亲和力的测定值，并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是受體結合親和力的測定值，並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A busy session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "繁忙的场次"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "繁忙的場次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change of scenery — even moving to a different room — can shift your headspace." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换个环境——即使只是换到另一个房间——可以改变心境。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "換個環境——即使只是換到另一個房間——可以改變心境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A check-in asks whether a dose worked the way it usually does. Once a few days carry an answer, this screen shows what they line up with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "状态确认会问这次剂量是不是像平时那样起效。等有几天带上了答案，这个页面就会显示它们和什么对得上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "狀態確認會問這次劑量是不是像平時那樣起效。等有幾天帶上了答案，這個頁面就會顯示它們和什麼對得上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A color for every substance you log" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为你记录的每种物质配一个颜色"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為你記錄的每種物質配一個顏色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A complete backup you can restore into Piru" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可恢复到 Piru 的完整备份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可還原至 Piru 的完整備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cool, dark room helps with headaches and overstimulation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "凉爽、昏暗的房间有助于缓解头痛和过度刺激。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "涼爽、昏暗的房間有助於緩解頭痛和過度刺激。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A couple of drinks, with the heart rate a watch recorded alongside." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两杯酒，以及手表同时记录的心率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩杯酒，以及手錶同時記錄的心率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom substance named \"%@\" already exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名为 \"%@\" 的自定义物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名為 \"%@\" 的自訂物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast route, like insufflation, outruns that adjustment and spikes. The same dose taken slowly lets the brain keep pace, so it barely registers as a rush." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼻吸等快速给药方式会甩开这种调整，形成骤升。同样的剂量若缓慢摄入，大脑得以跟上节奏，便几乎感受不到冲劲。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼻吸等快速給藥方式會甩開這種調整，形成驟升。同樣的劑量若緩慢攝入，大腦得以跟上節奏，便幾乎感受不到衝勁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast within-session fade, plus a modest, slower shift with heavy use. The effect on the heart fades far less than the felt effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "场次内的快速衰减，加上重度使用时幅度不大、更慢的变化。对心脏的作用衰减远小于主观感受到的作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "場次內的快速衰減，加上重度使用時幅度不大、更慢的變化。對心臟的作用衰減遠小於主觀感受到的作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A functional grouping rather than a mechanistic one: compounds taken for cognition, with radically different pharmacology and, mostly, thin human evidence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是按功能而非机制划分的一类：为改善认知而服用的化合物，药理各不相同，且大多缺乏充分的人体证据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是按功能而非機制劃分的一類：為改善認知而服用的化合物，藥理各不相同，且大多缺乏充分的人體證據。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up if one substance's daily total climbs into a heavy range, or tracked stock runs low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某一物质的当日总量攀升至大剂量范围，或追踪的库存不足时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某一物質的當日總量攀升至大劑量範圍，或追蹤的庫存不足時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up when something you track runs low or out — before the empty bottle surprises you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当你追踪的物品所剩不多或已用完时提前提醒——别等到瓶子空了才发现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當你追蹤的物品所剩不多或已用完時提前提醒——別等到瓶子空了才發現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up when your 12-hour total of one substance reaches the heavy range listed in its sources." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某一物质 12 小时内的累计量达到其来源列出的大剂量区间时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某一物質 12 小時內的累計量達到其來源列出的大劑量區間時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是实验室测定值，并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是實驗室測定值，並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A large serotonin load on top of lithium's own. The lithium label names tramadol and fentanyl in this group; serotonin syndrome can start within hours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在锂本身的血清素负荷之上再叠加一份很大的负荷。锂的说明书把曲马多和芬太尼列在这一组里；血清素综合征可在数小时内发作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在鋰本身的血清素負荷之上再疊加一份很大的負荷。鋰的說明書把曲馬多和吩坦尼列在這一組裡；血清素症候群可在數小時內發作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A larger dose draws dopamine stores down harder: a bigger rise, and a deeper dip once it clears." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更大的剂量会更猛地消耗多巴胺储备：升得更高，代谢完后也跌得更深。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更大的劑量會更猛地消耗多巴胺儲備：升得更高，代謝完後也跌得更深。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A level only means something with its draw time: for cypionate and enanthate, measure midway between injections; for undecanoate, measure at trough, just before the next dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个数值只有配上采血时间才有意义：环戊丙酸酯和庚酸酯在两次注射的中点测量；十一酸酯在谷值测量，即下一次给药之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個數值只有配上採血時間才有意義：環戊丙酸酯和庚酸酯在兩次注射的中點測量；十一酸酯在谷值測量，即下一次給藥之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A model estimate, not a measurement. What's in your body and what you feel don't always line up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型估算，非实测。体内留存与体感并不总是一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型估算，非實測。體內留存與體感並不總是一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A modeled relative load from your logged doses. It models receptor drive, not how you feel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据你记录的剂量推算出的相对负荷。它推算的是受体驱动，不是你的感受。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根據你記錄的劑量推算出的相對負荷。它推算的是受體驅動，不是你的感受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A night sky, five suits, fireworks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "夜空、五种花色、烟花"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "夜空、五種花色、煙火"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A one-compartment model with population-average half-lives. Real overlap depends on your metabolism, dose, route, and tolerance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单室模型，使用群体平均半衰期。实际重叠取决于你的代谢、剂量、途径和耐受性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單室模型，使用群體平均半衰期。實際重疊取決於你的代謝、劑量、途徑和耐受性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passphrase is required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要口令。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要通行碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passphrase-protected .piruenc file" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由口令保护的 .piruenc 文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由通行碼保護的 .piruenc 檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture of typical pharmacology." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "典型药理的概览。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "典型藥理的概覽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Piru or PsychonautWiki JSON file" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 或 PsychonautWiki 的 JSON 文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 或 PsychonautWiki 的 JSON 檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick read of how potent the drug is at that target — three dots is strong, one is weak. The same scale is used on the Mechanism card." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速判断药物对该靶点的作用强度——三个点表示强，一个点表示弱。与“作用机制”卡片使用同一标准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速判斷藥物對該靶點的作用強度——三個點表示強，一個點表示弱。與「作用機制」卡片使用同一標準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet prompt at a few points in the session, each opening a timestamped note. Off unless you turn it on, and you pick the times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在场次中的几个时间点上安静地提示一下，每次都会打开一条带时间戳的笔记。默认关闭，时间由你来定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在場次中的幾個時間點上安靜地提示一下，每次都會打開一條帶時間戳的筆記。預設關閉，時間由你來定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rare, peak, transcendental state — a serene and all-encompassing experience; the person, and the rating, are describing something outside the ordinary scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "罕见的巅峰、超越性状态——宁静而包容一切的体验；这个人和这个评级描述的都是常规量表之外的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "罕見的巔峰、超越性狀態——寧靜而包容一切的體驗；這個人和這個評級描述的都是常規量表之外的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A record and a model, not medical advice. Exposure uses published equivalents where they exist, and the substance's typical dose otherwise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一份记录和一个模型，不是医疗建议。暴露量在有已发表等效换算时采用该换算，否则采用该物质的典型剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是一份紀錄和一個模型，不是醫療建議。暴露量在有已發表等效換算時採用該換算，否則採用該物質的典型劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A relative model score for load on the body. It measures neither toxicity nor damage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体负荷的相对模型评分。它衡量的既不是毒性，也不是损伤。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體負荷的相對模型評分。它衡量的既不是毒性，也不是損傷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A releaser's output is limited by the vesicular dopamine still in store, and is suppressed further if a reuptake blocker is also on board. A blocker is not store-limited — it raises dopamine by slowing clearance rather than by pushing transmitter out. The two are handled by different code paths." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂的输出受限于囊泡中剩余的多巴胺存量；若同时存在再摄取抑制剂，还会被进一步压制。抑制剂则不受存量限制——它通过减慢清除而非推出递质来提升多巴胺。两者由不同的代码路径处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑的輸出受限於囊泡中剩餘的多巴胺存量；若同時存在再攝取抑制劑，還會被進一步壓制。抑制劑則不受存量限制——它透過減慢清除而非推出遞質來提升多巴胺。兩者由不同的程式路徑處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder at each time you set for a med. Tapping it opens Quick Log with that time's meds staged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你为药物设定的每个时间提醒你。点按提醒会打开快捷记录，并预先载入该时间的药物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你為藥物設定的每個時間提醒你。點按提醒會開啟快捷記錄，並預先載入該時間的藥物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder at each time. If you don't log it, Piru asks again %@ later — never a scold, just a nudge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个时间提醒一次。如果你没有记录，Piru 会在 %@ 后再问一次——从不是责备，只是轻轻提醒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每個時間提醒一次。如果你沒有記錄，Piru 會在 %@ 後再問一次——從不是責備，只是輕輕提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder to drink some water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你喝点水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你喝點水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder to drink some water. Stimulants can mask thirst." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你喝点水。兴奋剂可能掩盖口渴。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你喝點水。興奮劑可能掩蓋口渴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder to have some water if you can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你方便的话喝点水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你方便的話喝點水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder to sip, and to favor electrolytes. With this class more water is not safer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你小口喝，并优先选含电解质的饮品。对这一类来说，水喝得更多并不更安全。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒你小口喝，並優先選含電解質的飲品。對這一類來說，水喝得更多並不更安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rough guide, not medical advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅供粗略参考，并非医疗建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅供粗略參考，並非醫療建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safety net" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一道安全网"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一道安全網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second dose soon after the first lands weaker — the fast-releasing pool runs thin (tachyphylaxis). It refills overnight, so it's separate from the slower tolerance below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一剂之后很快再来一剂，效果会更弱——快速释放的储备变稀薄了（快速耐受）。它会在一夜之间补回，因此和下面那种更慢的耐受是两回事。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一劑之後很快再來一劑，效果會更弱——快速釋放的儲備變稀薄了（快速耐受）。它會在一夜之間補回，因此和下面那種更慢的耐受是兩回事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second plan is drawn as its own curve, so you can hold two ideas side by side — two meds, or a split dose against a single one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第二个方案会绘制为独立曲线，让你并排比较两种设想——两种药物，或分次服用与一次服用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第二個方案會繪製為獨立曲線，讓你並排比較兩種設想——兩種藥物，或分次服用與一次服用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A skin changes the app's colors, cards, and type. Your substance colors, the timeline, and every chart stay exactly as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "皮肤会改变应用的颜色、卡片和字体。你的物质颜色、时间轴和所有图表都保持原样。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "皮膚會改變應用程式的顏色、卡片和字體。你的物質顏色、時間軸和所有圖表都保持原樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sky that follows the day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随一天变化的天空"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隨一天變化的天空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A summary of how the drug affects the brain's three main signaling chemicals — serotonin, dopamine, and noradrenaline — and whether it releases them or blocks their reuptake. The slider shows which one it leans toward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述药物如何影响大脑三种主要的信号化学物质——血清素、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素——以及它是促进释放还是阻断再摄取。滑块显示它更偏向哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述藥物如何影響大腦三種主要的訊號化學物質——血清素、多巴胺和正腎上腺素——以及它是促進釋放還是阻斷再攝取。滑桿顯示它更偏向哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A third compound your body makes from this dose and something else in the session — not from either alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的身体用这次剂量和本场中的另一种物质生成的第三种化合物——单独任何一种都不会产生。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的身體用這次劑量和本場中的另一種物質生成的第三種化合物——單獨任何一種都不會產生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A walk outside helps when you're ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "准备好的时候，出去走走会有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "準備好的時候，出去走走會有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A warm bath can ease the achy, restless feeling — with someone in earshot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "泡个热水澡能缓解酸痛和坐立不安——让人待在听得见你的地方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "泡個熱水澡能緩解痠痛和坐立不安——讓人待在聽得見你的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A warm shower or light stretching helps tight muscles." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "冲个热水澡或做点轻柔拉伸，有助于放松紧绷的肌肉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衝個熱水澡或做點輕柔拉伸，有助於放鬆緊繃的肌肉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wind-down reminder late into long stimulant sessions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在长时间兴奋剂场次的后段提醒你收尾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在長時間興奮劑場次的後段提醒你收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
