            "value" : "Acil Yardim"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "across studies" : {
      "comment" : "Signature gate clause — ungated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跨研究"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跨研究"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Act at the CB1 receptor. The phytocannabinoids are partial agonists with a natural ceiling; the synthetic ones are full agonists without it, which is the whole of the difference in risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用于 CB1 受体。植物大麻素是有天然上限的部分激动剂；合成大麻素则是没有上限的完全激动剂，风险的差异全在于此。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用於 CB1 受體。植物大麻素是有天然上限的部分促效劑；合成大麻素則是沒有上限的完全促效劑，風險的差異全在於此。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Act at the κ-opioid receptor rather than 5-HT2A, which is why the experience is nothing like a classical psychedelic — dysphoric, disorienting, and usually brief." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用于 κ-阿片受体而非 5-HT2A，因此体验与经典迷幻剂截然不同——烦躁不安、方向迷失，且通常短暂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用於 κ-鴉片受體而非 5-HT2A，因此體驗與經典迷幻劑截然不同——煩躁不安、方向迷失，且通常短暫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activated by CYP2D6" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由 CYP2D6 活化"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由 CYP2D6 活化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activates 5-HT2B, which is linked to heart-valve damage (valvulopathy) with chronic or heavy use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "激活 5-HT2B；长期或大量使用与心脏瓣膜损害（瓣膜病变）相关。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活化 5-HT2B；長期或大量使用與心臟瓣膜損害（瓣膜病變）相關。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
