            "value" : "鎮靜與低血壓疊加——睏倦和頭暈增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive sedation and next-day grogginess — more drowsiness, dizziness, and fall risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静与次日昏沉相叠加——更困、更晕，跌倒风险更高。"
