    },
    "Adherence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依从性"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依從性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adherence tracks how consistently you take your scheduled meds. Add one and this screen starts working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依从性追踪你按计划服药的稳定程度。添加一项用药，这个页面就会开始工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依從性追蹤你按計劃服藥的穩定程度。新增一項用藥，這個頁面就會開始運作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust if you run higher or lower than average. A blood test replaces this with a fit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若你的水平高于或低于平均，可在此调整。验血后将由拟合取代。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若你的水平高於或低於平均，可在此調整。驗血後將由擬合取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust these times" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整这些时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "調整這些時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "調整時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjustment" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "校正"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "校正"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "after 21:00" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a break or in a new setting, tolerance drops — a dose that felt fine before can stop your breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段时间后，或换了环境，耐受会下降——以前没事的剂量可能让你停止呼吸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用一段時間後，或換了環境，耐受會下降——以前沒事的劑量可能讓你停止呼吸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a stimulant wears off, fatigue, irritability and low mood are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂消退之后，常有人感到疲劳、易怒和情绪低落。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑消退之後，常有人感到疲勞、易怒和情緒低落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After regular use, a seizure or severe confusion on stopping is an emergency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期规律使用后，停药时出现抽搐或严重意识混乱属于急症。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期規律使用後，停藥時出現抽搐或嚴重意識混亂屬於急症。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After regular use, stopping abruptly can be dangerous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用后，突然停用可能有危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用後，突然停用可能有危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After your latest dose" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你最近一次剂量之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你最近一次劑量之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Afterglow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "余韵"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
