    "Agonist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "激动剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "促效劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agonists at the 5-HT2A receptor. That single action reshapes perception, thought and the sense of self; the family splits by chemistry — phenethylamines, tryptamines, and the ergolines LSD belongs to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5-HT2A 受体的激动剂。这一个作用便重塑了知觉、思维和自我感；这一族按化学结构分为苯乙胺类、色胺类，以及 LSD 所属的麦角灵类。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5-HT2A 受體的促效劑。這一個作用便重塑了知覺、思維和自我感；這一族按化學結構分為苯乙胺類、色胺類，以及 LSD 所屬的麥角靈類。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agonists at the µ-opioid receptor: analgesia, warmth and sedation, and depressed breathing by the same mechanism. Tolerance to the first outpaces tolerance to the last, which is what makes the margin narrow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "μ-阿片受体的激动剂：镇痛、温暖与镇静，以及由同一机制导致的呼吸抑制。对前者的耐受快于对后者的耐受，这正是安全边际狭窄的原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "μ-鴉片受體的促效劑：鎮痛、溫暖與鎮靜，以及由同一機制導致的呼吸抑制。對前者的耐受快於對後者的耐受，這正是安全邊際狹窄的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI-Assisted Content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 辅助内容"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 輔助內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
