    "Alcohol" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol (ethanol)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精（乙醇）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精（乙醇）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol acts on the same receptors, and the combination can stop breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精作用于同一类受体，两者合用可能使呼吸停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精作用於同一類受體，兩者合用可能使呼吸停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol dehydrogenase saturates at about one drink, so clearance runs at a fixed rate and each extra drink stacks on the last. Chronic heavy drinking speeds clearance somewhat (CYP2E1 induction); the ALDH2 “flush” variant slows acetaldehyde clearance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乙醇脱氢酶在约一杯酒时饱和，此后以固定速率清除，每多一杯都叠加在上一杯之上。长期大量饮酒会略微加快清除（CYP2E1 诱导）；ALDH2“脸红”变异会减慢乙醛清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乙醇脫氫酶在約一杯酒時飽和，此後以固定速率清除，每多一杯都疊加在上一杯之上。長期大量飲酒會略微加快清除（CYP2E1 誘導）；ALDH2「臉紅」變異會減慢乙醛清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol disrupts the sleep you need." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精会扰乱你需要的睡眠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精會擾亂你需要的睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol stacks psychomotor and memory impairment on top of the sleep med (and raises lemborexant's blood levels) — expect worse next-day grogginess and unsteadiness. The labels advise against drinking with these." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精会在这类安眠药之上叠加精神运动和记忆损害（并会升高莱博雷生的血药浓度）——次日昏沉和站立不稳会更明显。药品说明书建议服用期间不要饮酒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "酒精會在這類安眠藥之上疊加精神運動和記憶損害（並會升高萊博雷生的血藥濃度）——隔日昏沉和站立不穩會更明顯。藥品仿單建議服用期間不要飲酒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol, benzodiazepines and opioids on top of a dissociative raise the risk of stopped breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在解离剂之上叠加酒精、苯二氮䓬类或阿片类，会提高呼吸停止的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在解離劑之上疊加酒精、苯二氮平類或鴉片類，會提高呼吸停止的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alcohol, benzodiazepines and other depressants on top of an opioid raise the risk of stopped breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在阿片类之上叠加酒精、苯二氮䓬类或其他中枢抑制药，会提高呼吸停止的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在鴉片類之上疊加酒精、苯二氮平類或其他中樞抑制藥，會提高呼吸停止的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
