    "All of it is a set of coupled differential equations advanced by forward Euler in half-minute steps across twelve hours or more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一切构成一组耦合微分方程，以前向欧拉法按半分钟步长推进，跨越十二小时以上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一切構成一組耦合微分方程，以前向尤拉法按半分鐘步長推進，跨越十二小時以上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All of these have passed. Times are measured from your latest dose." : {
