    "As a benzodiazepine wears off, rebound anxiety and restlessness are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮䓬类消退时，常有人出现反跳性焦虑和坐立不安。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮平類消退時，常有人出現反跳性焦慮和坐立不安。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a depressant wears off, feeling shaky, anxious or nauseous is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢抑制药消退时，常有人感到发抖、焦虑或恶心。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞抑制藥消退時，常有人感到發抖、焦慮或噁心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As a stimulant takes hold, dopamine climbs quickly. Your brain expects a steady baseline and adjusts toward the new level, but it catches up slowly. The gap between the two — dopamine now versus what your brain expects — is what reaches you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当兴奋剂开始起效，多巴胺迅速攀升。大脑预期的是一个稳定的基线，会向新水平调整，但追赶得很慢。二者之间的落差——当前多巴胺与大脑所预期之间——正是你所感受到的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當興奮劑開始起效，多巴胺迅速攀升。大腦預期的是一個穩定的基線，會向新水平調整，但追趕得很慢。二者之間的落差——當前多巴胺與大腦所預期之間——正是你所感受到的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As an opioid fades, increased pain sensitivity, restlessness and mild nausea are commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阿片类药效消退时，常有人出现痛觉敏感增加、坐立不安和轻度恶心。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鴉片類藥效消退時，常有人出現痛覺敏感增加、坐立不安和輕度噁心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
