            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按星期統計的中等劑量單位，%@ 最多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common-dose units count each dose as a multiple of its common dose. %lld of %lld substances have one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Common-dose units count each dose as a multiple of its common dose. %1$lld of %2$lld substances have one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中等剂量单位将每次剂量按其中等剂量的倍数计。已定义：%lld / %lld 种物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中等劑量單位將每次劑量按其中等劑量的倍數計。已定義：%lld / %lld 種物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported early on. Small sips rather than gulps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期常见。小口喝，别大口灌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期常見。小口喝，別大口灌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported here. Some people find moving a little easier than sitting still." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里很常见。有些人觉得稍微动一动比坐着不动更好受。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡很常見。有些人覺得稍微動一動比坐著不動更好受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported on the way down. Worth noting when it started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下行阶段常见。值得记下它是什么时候开始的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下行階段常見。值得記下它是什麼時候開始的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported while a stimulating dose is active. The curve is an estimate and can't say when you will sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在有兴奋作用的剂量仍然活跃期间很常见。曲线只是估计，无法说明你什么时候能睡着。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在有興奮作用的劑量仍然活躍期間很常見。曲線只是估計，無法說明你什麼時候能睡著。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported with this class. A familiar person or place helps more than arguing with the thought." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一类常见的报告。熟悉的人或地方，比和这个念头争辩更有用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這一類常見的報告。熟悉的人或地方，比和這個念頭爭辯更有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commonly reported with this class. A severe tremor, or one that comes with confusion or a high temperature, is a reason to get help now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该类药物常有这种报告。严重的震颤，或伴随意识混乱、高热的震颤，应当立刻求助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該類藥物常有這種回報。嚴重的顫抖，或伴隨意識混亂、高燒的顫抖，應當立刻求助。"
