          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比較不同物質，預覽它們可能帶來的感受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the shape of a curve more than its exact height." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多比较曲线的形状，而非其确切高度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多比較曲線的形狀，而非其確切高度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare with another plan" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与另一个方案比较"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "與另一個方案比較"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Competitively blocks the orexin (hypocretin) receptors OX1R and OX2R, the targets of the wake-promoting neuropeptides orexin-A and orexin-B released from the lateral hypothalamus. Rather than broadly sedating the brain like a GABAergic hypnotic, it withdraws a specific \"stay awake\" drive that stabilizes arousal — permitting the natural transition into sleep with largely preserved sleep architecture and arousability. Because it does not enhance GABA or depress brainstem respiratory centers, it lacks the respiratory-depression synergy and dependence liability characteristic of benzodiazepines, Z-drugs, and other GABAergic sedatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "竞争性阻断食欲素（下丘脑分泌素）受体 OX1R 和 OX2R，这两种受体是外侧下丘脑释放的促醒神经肽食欲素-A 和食欲素-B 的作用靶点。它不像 GABA 能催眠药那样广泛抑制大脑，而是撤除一种维持觉醒的特定“保持清醒”驱动力——让人自然过渡到睡眠，同时基本保留睡眠结构和可唤醒性。由于它既不增强 GABA，也不抑制脑干呼吸中枢，因此没有苯二氮䓬类、Z 类药物及其他 GABA 能镇静剂所特有的呼吸抑制协同作用和依赖风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "競爭性阻斷食慾素（下視丘分泌素）受體 OX1R 和 OX2R，這兩種受體是外側下視丘釋放的促醒神經肽食慾素-A 和食慾素-B 的作用標的。它不像 GABA 能催眠藥那樣廣泛抑制大腦，而是撤除一種維持覺醒的特定「保持清醒」驅動力——讓人自然過渡到睡眠，同時基本保留睡眠結構和可喚醒性。由於它既不增強 GABA，也不抑制腦幹呼吸中樞，因此沒有苯二氮平類、Z 類藥物及其他 GABA 能鎮靜劑所特有的呼吸抑制協同作用和依賴風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded CNS depression — excessive sedation and impaired breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的中枢抑制——过度镇静和呼吸受损。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加的中樞抑制——過度鎮靜和呼吸受損。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded dissociation — disorientation and loss of motor control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的解离——定向障碍和运动控制丧失。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加的解離——定向障礙和運動控制喪失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded drowsiness and impaired coordination." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的嗜睡和协调受损。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加的嗜睡和協調受損。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded sedation — stronger, deeper drowsiness. GHB suppresses breathing on its own, and added sedation makes that harder to notice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静叠加——更强、更深的困倦。GHB 本身就会抑制呼吸，而额外的镇静会让这一点更难被察觉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮靜疊加——更強、更深的睏倦。GHB 本身就會抑制呼吸，而額外的鎮靜會讓這一點更難被察覺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded sedation and low blood pressure — stronger drowsiness and dizziness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静与低血压叠加——困倦和头晕加重。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮靜與低血壓疊加——睏倦和頭暈加重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compress Empty Time" : {
