    },
    "Desipramine is a marketed antidepressant in its own right, and more noradrenergic than imipramine — so as it forms, the effect shifts toward the more activating end." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地昔帕明本身就是一种上市的抗抑郁药，比丙咪嗪更偏向去甲肾上腺素能——因此随着它的生成，效应向更具激活性的方向转移。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地昔帕明本身就是一種上市的抗憂鬱藥，比丙咪嗪更偏向正腎上腺素能——因此隨著它的生成，效應向更具活化性的方向轉移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Desired Concentration" : {
      "localizations" : {
