          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "doi:10.3390/ijms27031430"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't isolate yourself. Let someone know where you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要独自一人。让某人知道你在哪里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要獨自一人。讓某人知道你在哪裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't judge your baseline mood by how you feel right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要以现在的感受来判断你的基线情绪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要以現在的感受來判斷你的基線情緒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't make big life decisions based on acute revelations — wait a week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要根据当下的顿悟做出重大人生决定——等一周再说。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要根據當下的頓悟做出重大人生決定——等一週再說。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't try to 'figure it all out' right now. Integration takes days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在不要试图“想通一切”。整合需要数天。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在不要試圖「想通一切」。整合需要數天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't use alone and don't mix with other downers. An overdose is a sudden blackout with no warning — you can't naloxone yourself, so someone with you needs it and should call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要独自使用，也不要与其他抑制剂混用。过量会毫无预兆地突然失去意识——你无法给自己使用纳洛酮，因此身边的人需要备有纳洛酮，并应拨打急救电话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要獨自使用，也不要與其他抑制劑混用。過量會毫無預兆地突然失去意識——你無法給自己使用納洛酮，因此身邊的人需要備有納洛酮，並應撥打急救電話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
