      }
    },
    "Dosed in low milligrams — use a milligram scale (0.001 g). Can't be measured by eye or kitchen scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量仅几毫克，请用毫克秤（0.001 g）。无法目测或用厨房秤称量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量僅幾毫克，請用毫克秤（0.001 g）。無法目測或用廚房秤稱量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses add with no plateau, and the gap between a sedating dose and a fatal one is narrow to begin with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量相加且不会趋于平缓，而镇静剂量与致死剂量之间的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量相加且不會趨於平緩，而鎮靜劑量與致死劑量之間的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses are milligrams of THC. Flower needed ≈ desired THC ÷ the strain's %THC (e.g. 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g). Smoking loses 50–80% to combustion, so real flower amounts run higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量是 THC 的毫克数。所需花量 ≈ 目标 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食会因燃烧损失 50–80%，因此实际所需花量更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量是 THC 的毫克數。所需花量 ≈ 目標 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食會因燃燒損失 50–80%，因此實際所需花量更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses before this hour count toward the previous day. Set to 12 AM for standard calendar days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此时间之前的剂量计入前一天。设为 12 AM 即按标准日历日。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此時間之前的劑量計入前一天。設為 12 AM 即按標準日曆日。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses in other units aren't counted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他单位的剂量不计入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他單位的劑量不計入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses logged per day over the past two weeks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去两周每天记录的剂量数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "過去兩週每天記錄的劑量數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses stay the substance's own — only the duration curve changes." : {
      "comment" : "Branded formulations: clarifies the dose ladder is unaffected",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量仍为该物质本身的剂量——只有作用时长曲线会改变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量仍為該物質本身的劑量——只有作用時長曲線會改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses you log sync between your iPhone and a paired Apple Watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你记录的剂量会在 iPhone 和已配对的 Apple Watch 之间同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你記錄的劑量會在 iPhone 和已配對的 Apple Watch 之間同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing Defaults" : {
      "localizations" : {
