            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗幻劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each card is that substance's own contribution. Mechanisms are shared, so your overall level (the chart above, or By mechanism) can be higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张卡片是该物质自身的贡献。机制是共享的，所以你的整体水平（上方图表或“按机制”）可能更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每張卡片是該物質自身的貢獻。機制是共享的，所以你的整體水平（上方圖表或「按機制」）可能更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each comparison cuts your rated days on one thing at a time and counts how often the dose read \"about right\" or more. These describe your entries; they don't show that a substance, dose, or timing caused a difference." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一组对照每次只按一件事切分你打过分的日子，数一数其中有多少次读作“和平时差不多”或更强。这些只是在描述你的记录；它们并不说明是某种物质、剂量或时间造成了差异。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一組對照每次只按一件事切分你打過分的日子，數一數其中有多少次讀作「和平時差不多」或更強。這些只是在描述你的記錄；它們並不說明是某種物質、劑量或時間造成了差異。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each ester's own release, before they sum to the serum estimate above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种酯各自的释放，在汇总为上方的血清估计值之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每種酯各自的釋放，在彙總為上方的血清估計值之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line as a share of its own peak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条线按自身峰值的比例显示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條線按自身峰值的比例顯示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row lists what that source supplied here. Links open the source's own page — always verify against the original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出该来源在此提供的内容。链接会打开来源自身的页面——请始终对照原始资料核实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出該來源在此提供的內容。連結會開啟來源自身的頁面——請始終對照原始資料核實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each substance page lists which of these supplied each field." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个物质页面都会列出各个字段由其中哪个来源提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個物質頁面都會列出各個欄位由其中哪個來源提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each substance page names the source of each field. Text from PsychonautWiki and FreeOD Wiki is used under CC BY-SA 4.0, edited and merged with other sources, and remains available under that license." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个物质页面都会标明每个字段的来源。来自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文本依 CC BY-SA 4.0 使用，经编辑并与其他来源合并，并继续依该许可提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個物質頁面都會標明每個欄位的來源。來自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文字依 CC BY-SA 4.0 使用，經編輯並與其他來源合併，並繼續依該授權提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat light foods: fruit, toast, soup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点清淡的：水果、吐司、汤。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點清淡的：水果、吐司、湯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something balanced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点营养均衡的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點營養均衡的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something grounding — warm food, fruit, or anything that sounds appealing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些让人安定的东西——温热的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些讓人安定的東西——溫熱的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something nutritious — protein, carbs, and fruit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些营养食物——蛋白质、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些營養食物——蛋白質、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something with salt, protein, and carbs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点含盐、蛋白质和碳水的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點含鹽、蛋白質和碳水的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something, even without hunger. Protein and complex carbs are the usual suggestion." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使不饿也吃点东西。通常建议蛋白质和复合碳水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使不餓也吃點東西。通常建議蛋白質和複合碳水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EC50 %@ nM" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EDDP has no opioid activity — it's the primary urinary marker for methadone compliance monitoring, not a contributor to the drug's effect or duration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 无阿片活性——它是美沙酮依从性监测的主要尿液标志物，不参与药物效应或持续时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 無鴉片活性——它是美沙酮依從性監測的主要尿液標誌物，不參與藥物效應或持續時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edibles also come on slowly — usually 30 minutes to 2 hours — and last much longer, often 6–10 hours. That slow start is the redose trap: more taken before the first dose has arrived stacks into a far stronger, longer experience than intended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用型起效也慢——通常要 30 分钟到 2 小时——而且持续得久得多，常常 6–10 小时。这种慢起效正是补服的陷阱：在第一剂还没上来之前再吃，叠起来的体验会比预想的强得多、久得多。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用型起效也慢——通常要 30 分鐘到 2 小時——而且持續得久得多，常常 6–10 小時。這種慢起效正是補服的陷阱：在第一劑還沒上來之前再吃，疊起來的體驗會比預想的強得多、久得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
