    "Feeling" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling bad is a listed effect of this class. It still deserves attention — Piru can't tell whether a symptom is harmless." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感觉糟糕是这一类列出的效应。它仍然值得重视——Piru 无法判断一个症状是否无害。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感覺糟糕是這一類列出的效應。它仍然值得重視——Piru 無法判斷一個症狀是否無害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling emotionally open, contemplative, or just tired afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人感到情感开放、若有所思，或只是疲惫。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人感到情感開放、若有所思，或只是疲憊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling foggy or unreal for a while afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人会有一段时间感觉昏沉或不真实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人會有一段時間感覺昏沉或不真實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling foggy, lethargic or mildly irritable afterwards is commonly reported." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事后常有人感觉昏沉、倦怠或轻微易怒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事後常有人感覺昏沉、倦怠或輕微易怒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling hot and cold is commonly reported. A high temperature that rest and cooling don't bring down is an emergency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人忽冷忽热。休息和降温都压不下去的高热属于急症。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常有人忽冷忽熱。休息和降溫都壓不下去的高熱屬於急症。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling less sedated does not establish that memory or coordination are unimpaired — tolerance to sedation builds faster than tolerance to impairment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感觉没那么困，并不能证明记忆或协调性没有受损——对镇静的耐受比对功能受损的耐受形成得更快。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感覺沒那麼睏，並不能證明記憶或協調性沒有受損——對鎮靜的耐受比對功能受損的耐受形成得更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeling sums reward, serotonin and opioid warmth, and liking, minus the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“感受”将奖赏、血清素与阿片类带来的暖意以及喜爱相加，再减去药效下降期。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「感受」將獎賞、血清素與鴉片類帶來的暖意以及喜愛相加，再減去藥效下降期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
