    "High cumulative benzo doses impair memory and coordination. Stay somewhere safe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮䓬累积剂量较高会损害记忆和协调能力。留在安全的地方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯二氮平累積劑量較高會損害記憶和協調能力。留在安全的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上参考线"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上參考線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher is livelier. Drive rises above the line, sedation sits below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高越有活力。驱动力升至基线之上，镇静则落于其下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高越有活力。驅動力升至基線之上，鎮靜則落於其下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher is more pleasure. The opioid warmth signal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高愉悦越强。阿片类的温暖信号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高愉悅越強。鴉片類的溫暖訊號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher is more pull toward another dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数值越高，想再来一剂的拉力越强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "數值越高，想再來一劑的拉力越強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher is more pull. The rush and craving signal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高渴求越强。快感冲击与渴求的信号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "越高渴求越強。快感衝擊與渴求的訊號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Higher-priority sources that don't list this field are skipped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "优先级更高但未提供此项的来源会被跳过。"
