    },
    "How dosing, tolerance, and recovery work" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解给药、耐受与恢复的原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解給藥、耐受與恢復的原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Encryption Works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加密原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加密原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fast your body removes the drug, mostly via the liver and kidneys." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体清除药物的速度，主要通过肝脏和肾脏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體清除藥物的速度，主要透過肝臟和腎臟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How hard each mechanism has been driven over time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各机制随时间被驱动的程度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各機制隨時間被驅動的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How is it going?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在感觉如何？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在感覺如何？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it is solved" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如何求解"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如何求解"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long after taking it the level in your blood is highest — roughly when effects peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用药后多久血液中的浓度达到最高——大致也是效果最强的时刻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用藥後多久血液中的濃度達到最高——大致也是效果最強的時刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Long It Stays" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在体内停留多久"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在體內停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long that lasts varies between people, and the kinetics in humans aren't well measured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持续多久因人而异，人体中的动力学也没有被很好地测量过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持續多久因人而異，人體中的動力學也沒有被很好地測量過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many substances a session needs before it splits into lanes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个场次需要多少种物质才会拆分为泳道。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一個場次需要多少種物質才會拆分為泳道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Modeled Tolerance Works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型推算耐受的原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型推算耐受的原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much detail?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少细节？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少細節？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much is estimated to be in your body, using only data from this session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用本场次的数据估算出的体内存量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅用本場次的資料估算出的體內存量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose actually reaches your bloodstream. Swallowing a drug usually delivers less than injecting it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用药中真正进入血液的比例。口服通常比注射进入血液的量更少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用藥中真正進入血液的比例。口服通常比注射進入血液的量更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose becomes its active form is partly genetic — the same dose can produce noticeably more effect in some people than in others." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一剂中有多少转化为活性形式部分取决于基因。同样的剂量在某些人身上效应明显更强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一劑中有多少轉化為活性形式部分取決於基因。同樣的劑量在某些人身上效應明顯更強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much pharmacology a substance page and the Tolerance tool open with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "物质页面和耐受工具默认展开多少药理内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "物質頁面和耐受工具預設展開多少藥理內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strong it is compared to %@ hasn't been established." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相对于 %@ 的强度尚无定论。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相對於 %@ 的強度尚無定論。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strong that is tracks how much and how often you've been using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其强度取决于你用了多少、多频繁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其強度取決於你用了多少、多頻繁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the drug acts in the body — which receptors and transporters it targets, and what it does at each (switches them on, blocks them, and so on). The dots show how strongly it acts at each target." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "药物在体内如何起作用——它作用于哪些受体和转运体，以及在每个靶点上做什么（激活、阻断等）。圆点表示它在各靶点上的作用强度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藥物在體內如何起作用——它作用於哪些受體和轉運體，以及在每個靶點上做什麼（活化、阻斷等）。圓點表示它在各靶點上的作用強度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this is calculated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
