    "Increase" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increase amount" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加剂量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加劑量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increased" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上升"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上升"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increased anxiety and vasoconstriction — stimulants can intensify difficult trips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "焦虑加剧和血管收缩——兴奋剂会加重艰难的体验。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "焦慮加劇和血管收縮——興奮劑會加重艱難的體驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increased heart rate and blood pressure — cardiovascular strain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心率和血压增加——心血管压力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心率和血壓增加——心血管壓力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increases central nervous system activity by enhancing monoamine neurotransmission, typically through increased release or reduced reuptake of dopamine and/or norepinephrine. The specific mechanism varies by substance class (releasing agents, reuptake inhibitors, or receptor agonists). Effects include increased alertness, attention, and energy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过增强单胺神经传递增加中枢神经系统活性，通常通过增加释放或减少多巴胺和/或去甲肾上腺素的再摄取。具体机制因物质类别（释放剂、再摄取抑制剂或受体激动剂）而异。效应包括警觉度、注意力和能量增加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過增強單胺神經傳導增加中樞神經系統活性，通常透過增加釋放或減少多巴胺和/或正腎上腺素的再攝取。具體機制因物質類別（釋放劑、再攝取抑制劑或受體促效劑）而異。效應包括警覺度、注意力和能量增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increases synaptic serotonin, dopamine, and norepinephrine, with a predominant serotonergic component that distinguishes empathogens from classical stimulants. Many also stimulate the release of oxytocin from the hypothalamus, contributing to prosocial effects, emotional openness, and feelings of empathy and connectedness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加突触血清素、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素，以血清素能成分为主，这使共情剂与经典兴奋剂相区别。许多还刺激下丘脑释放催产素，助长亲社会效应、情感开放及共情和连结感。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加突觸血清素、多巴胺和正腎上腺素，以血清素能成分為主，這使共情劑與經典興奮劑相區別。許多還刺激下丘腦釋放催產素，助長親社會效應、情感開放及共情和連結感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Individual response varies with tolerance, body chemistry, and the day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个体反应会因耐受、体质和当天状态而不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "個體反應會因耐受、體質和當天狀態而不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Induces %@, which clears the hormones in the combined pill, patch, ring, implant and hormonal IUD — lowering their levels. Anyone relying on hormonal contraception should consider a backup method. Often noted on the label, but easy to miss." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可诱导 %@，加速复方口服避孕药、避孕贴剂、阴道避孕环、皮下埋植剂及含激素宫内节育器中激素的代谢，从而降低其血药浓度。依赖激素类避孕的人群应考虑采用备用避孕措施。说明书中通常有提示，但容易被忽略。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可誘導 %@，加速複方口服避孕藥、避孕貼劑、陰道避孕環、皮下埋植劑及含激素宮內節育器中激素的代謝，從而降低其血藥濃度。依賴激素類避孕的人群應考慮採用備用避孕措施。說明書中通常有提示，但容易被忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
