    "Manual schedule" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手动方案"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手動方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many values come from animal or lab-dish studies. Human data is the most reliable — the source tag tells you which it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多数值来自动物或体外（培养皿）实验。人体数据最为可靠——来源标签会标明属于哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許多數值來自動物或體外（培養皿）實驗。人體資料最為可靠——來源標籤會標明屬於哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MAOIs block the enzyme that clears serotonin, so the load builds instead of levelling off. Serotonin syndrome is the risk; MAOIs do not raise lithium levels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MAOI 阻断清除血清素的酶，因此负荷会不断累积而不是趋于平稳。风险是血清素综合征；MAOI 不会升高锂的血药浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MAOI 阻斷清除血清素的酶，因此負荷會不斷累積而不是趨於平穩。風險是血清素症候群；MAOI 不會升高鋰的血藥濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Markdown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markdown"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markdown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Markdown — notes with T+ offsets" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markdown——带 T+ 偏移的笔记"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markdown——帶 T+ 偏移的筆記"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marks the amount after this as a full supply, so the bar can show how full you are. Leave off if this isn't a full restock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将此操作后的数量标记为满量，进度条便能显示你的充足程度。如果这不是一次补满，请关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將此操作後的數量標記為滿量，進度條便能顯示你的充足程度。如果這不是一次補滿，請關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "max" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最大"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "maximum concentration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最高血药浓度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最高血藥濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "May reduce hormonal birth-control efficacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素类避孕药的效果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素類避孕藥的效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mCPP acts on serotonin in a different way than trazodone — it tends to feel activating or anxious rather than sedating, which is part of why trazodone's later hours can feel unlike its calm onset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同于曲唑酮的方式作用于血清素——它倾向于产生激活感或焦虑感，而非镇静，这是曲唑酮后半段感受可能与平静的起效阶段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同於曲唑酮的方式作用於血清素——它傾向於產生亢奮感或焦慮感，而非鎮靜，這是曲唑酮後半段感受可能與平靜的起效階段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDA is an active drug of its own — more amphetamine-like and more hallucinogenic than MDMA, and longer-lived — so the later hours can feel qualitatively different from the peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一种活性药物——比 MDMA 更像苯丙胺、致幻性更强，也更持久——因此后段时间的体验在性质上会与高峰期不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一種活性藥物——比 MDMA 更像安非他命、致幻性更強，也更持久——因此後段時間的體驗在性質上會與高峰期不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA releases serotonin in bulk and lithium adds to it, so serotonin syndrome is the main risk. Seizures are reported for lithium with classic psychedelics; MDMA has not been looked at the same way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 会大量释放血清素，锂在此之上再加一份，因此主要风险是血清素综合征。锂与经典迷幻剂合用有癫痫发作的报告；MDMA 没有被同样地研究过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 會大量釋放血清素，鋰在此之上再加一份，因此主要風險是血清素症候群。鋰與經典迷幻劑合用有癲癇發作的報告；MDMA 沒有被同樣地研究過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured at %@× %@'s %@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Measured at %1$@× %2$@'s %3$@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测定值为 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——这是实验室测定值，并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測定值為 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——這是實驗室測定值，並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured at %@× %@'s %@ at the %@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Measured at %1$@× %2$@'s %3$@ at the %4$@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在%4$@上测定值为 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——这是实验室测定值，并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在%4$@上測定值為 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——這是實驗室測定值，並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured Interactions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实测相互作用"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實測交互作用"
