    "No genetics, no metabolizer phenotype, and no drug–drug metabolic interaction. Interactions are pharmacodynamic only: shared transporters, shared stores, shared receptors." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不含遗传因素、代谢表型，也不含药物间代谢相互作用。相互作用仅限药效学层面：共用转运体、共用存量、共用受体。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不含遺傳因素、代謝表型，也不含藥物間代謝交互作用。交互作用僅限藥效學層面：共用轉運體、共用存量、共用受體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
