    "Offset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "消退期"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "消退期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Often mis-sold as MDMA / “molly,” but it is pharmacologically a reuptake blocker — longer, more stimulant and anxiogenic, and more dangerous on an empathogen-style redose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常被冒充为 MDMA／“molly”出售，但其药理上是再摄取抑制剂——作用更持久、更偏兴奋和致焦虑，按共情剂的方式补服时更危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常被冒充為 MDMA／「molly」出售，但其藥理上是再攝取抑制劑——作用更持久、更偏興奮和致焦慮，按共情劑的方式補服時更危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older studies used radioimmunoassay; modern LC-MS/MS reads lower. Calibrating to your own results absorbs the difference." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期研究使用放射免疫法，现代 LC-MS/MS 读数偏低。按你的结果校准可消除差异。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期研究使用放射免疫法，現代 LC-MS/MS 讀數偏低。按你的結果校準可消除差異。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a fixed schedule doses overlap and the level climbs until intake and clearance balance: steady state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定方案下各剂量相互重叠，水平持续上升，直到摄入与清除平衡：稳态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定方案下各劑量相互重疊，水平持續上升，直到攝入與清除平衡：穩態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a U-100 syringe" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "U-100 注射器刻度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "U-100 注射器刻度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现有量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現有量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the way down the expectation lags again. Dopamine returns to baseline while the expectation stays high, and that gap below the line is the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下降过程中，预期再次滞后。多巴胺已回到基线，预期却仍居高不下，基线之下的这段落差便是药效下降期。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下降過程中，預期再次滯後。多巴胺已回到基線，預期卻仍居高不下，基線之下的這段落差便是藥效下降期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On This Device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此设备上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此裝置上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once daily" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天一次"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once the compensatory response is conditioned, presenting the cues without the drug leaves the push-back running unopposed. The result feels like the drug's mirror: a stimulant's familiar setting without the stimulant can produce fatigue, an opioid's without the opioid can produce aches. This is one route into situational withdrawal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一旦代偿反应被条件化了，只给信号不给药，反向调整就会在无抵消的情况下运作。感觉就像药效的反面：兴奋剂的熟悉环境里没有兴奋剂，可能会产生疲惫感；阿片类药物的熟悉环境里没有阿片类药物，可能会出现酸痛。这是情境性戒断的一条路径。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一旦代償反應被條件化了，只給訊號不給藥，反向調整就會在無抵消的情況下運作。感覺就像藥效的反面：興奮劑的熟悉環境裡沒有興奮劑，可能會產生疲憊感；鴉片類藥物的熟悉環境裡沒有鴉片類藥物，可能會出現痠痛。這是情境性戒斷的一條路徑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ondansetron" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昂丹司琼"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
