            "value" : "愉悅和暖意升到線以上；藥效下降期沉到線以下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plum and fuchsia, from the open encyclopedia" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "梅紫与紫红，来自开放百科"
