    "Real tolerance that drops after a break or a change of setting — which is exactly what makes returning to an old dose dangerous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实打实的耐受，停一阵子或换了环境就会掉——这正是为什么回到以前的剂量会很危险。"
