          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release EC₅₀" : {
      "comment" : "Ternary basis option",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放 EC₅₀"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放 EC₅₀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release serotonin, along with dopamine and noradrenaline — warmth, closeness and emotional openness rather than the perceptual change of a psychedelic. Most are amphetamines with a methylenedioxy ring." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放血清素，以及多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素——带来温暖、亲近和情感开放，而非迷幻剂的知觉改变。多数是带有亚甲二氧基环的苯丙胺。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放血清素，以及多巴胺和正腎上腺素——帶來溫暖、親近和情感開放，而非迷幻劑的知覺改變。多數是帶有亞甲二氧基環的安非他命。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放时间窗"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放時間窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release Window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放时间窗"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放時間窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Releaser" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Releasers and reuptake blockers diverge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂与再摄取抑制剂就此分道"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑與再攝取抑制劑就此分道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Releasers spend vesicular stores in proportion to concentration, and dopamine elevation itself throttles resynthesis — so the debt deepens while the drug is still on board rather than being repaid in real time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂消耗囊泡存量的速度与浓度成正比，而多巴胺升高本身又抑制再合成——因此在药物仍在体内时亏空会不断加深，而非实时偿还。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑消耗囊泡存量的速度與濃度成正比，而多巴胺升高本身又抑制再合成——因此在藥物仍在體內時虧空會不斷加深，而非即時償還。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Releasing Agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relevant to you" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你相关"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "與你相關"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remember to hydrate, eat, and try to get some sleep. Your heart has been working hard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记得补水、吃饭并尝试入睡。你的心脏一直在努力工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記得補水、吃飯並嘗試入睡。你的心臟一直在努力工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remind Me" : {
      "localizations" : {
