          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders and adherence tracking stop. Doses you already logged stay in your journal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒和依从性追踪将停止。你已经记录的剂量仍保留在日记中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒和依從性追蹤將停止。你已經記錄的劑量仍保留在日記中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders at each routine's time — and, if you want, a gentle re-ask a little later, like snooze." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个日常设定的时间提醒你——如果需要，稍后还会像闹钟稍后提醒一样轻轻再问一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每個日常設定的時間提醒你——如果需要，稍後還會像鬧鐘稍後提醒一樣輕輕再問一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders fire at each med's times. Quiet meds share one reminder per time of day. Logging a dose clears its follow-ups." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒按每种药物的设定时间触发。静默用药在每个时段共用一条提醒。记录剂量后后续提醒自动取消。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒按每種藥物的設定時間觸發。靜默用藥在每個時段共用一則提醒。記錄劑量後後續提醒自動取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒已关闭"
          }
