            "value" : "鎮靜與抑制劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See how doses might feel over time — compare two meds, preview a stack, or change the timing — without logging anything. This is a scratch surface; nothing here touches your journal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看不同剂量随时间可能带来的感受——比较两种药物、预览叠加、或调整时间——无需记录任何内容。这是一个草稿区，不会影响你的记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看不同劑量隨時間可能帶來的感受——比較兩種藥物、預覽疊加、或調整時間——無需記錄任何內容。這是一個草稿區，不會影響你的記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See the model's estimate of what is still active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看模型对仍在活跃的内容的估计"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檢視模型對仍在活躍的內容的估計"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See your current session's doses at a glance." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一目了然地查看当前场次的剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
