    },
    "Shows your body weight, heart rate, blood pressure and workouts from Health alongside your journal. Change what Piru can see in the Health app's settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把“健康”中的体重、心率、血压和锻炼与你的日记并排显示。可在“健康”App 的设置中更改 Piru 能看到的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把「健康」中的體重、心率、血壓和體能訓練與你的日記並排顯示。可在「健康」App 的設定中更改 Piru 能看到的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows your heart rate and blood pressure on each session's timeline. If something didn't connect — blood pressure especially, which iOS doesn't always prompt for — open **Settings ▸ Privacy & Security ▸ Health ▸ Piru** and turn it on there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个场次的时间线上显示你的心率和血压。如果有项目没连上——尤其是血压，iOS 并不总会为它弹出询问——请打开 **设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性 ▸ 健康 ▸ Piru**，在那里开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每個場次的時間軸上顯示你的心率和血壓。如果有項目沒連上——尤其是血壓，iOS 並不總會為它跳出詢問——請開啟 **設定 ▸ 隱私權與安全性 ▸ 健康 ▸ Piru**，在那裡開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
