          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some reference text was drafted with AI assistance and reviewed before publication. AI output is not treated as evidence. Quantitative and safety-critical claims are checked against identified sources, which are listed on each substance page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分参考文字由 AI 辅助起草，并在发布前经过审阅。AI 的输出不被当作证据。定量的和与安全相关的说法都会对照已标明的来源进行核对，这些来源列在每个物质页面上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分參考文字由 AI 輔助起草，並在發布前經過審閱。AI 的輸出不被當作證據。定量的和與安全相關的說法都會對照已標明的來源進行核對，這些來源列在每個物質頁面上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some tolerance only develops if you experience the effect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些耐受只有在你体验到那种效果时才会形成"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些耐受只有在你體驗到那種效果時才會形成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone who knows you can help more than you’d expect. You don’t have to explain everything — just hearing a familiar voice helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解你的人比你想象的更能提供帮助。你不必解释一切——只是听到熟悉的声音就有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解你的人比你想像的更能提供幫助。你不必解釋一切——只是聽到熟悉的聲音就有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
