    "Stop Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止实时活动"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止即時動態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping a beta-blocker abruptly after regular use can make heart rate and blood pressure rebound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用后突然停用 β 受体阻滞剂，可能让心率和血压反弹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用後突然停用 β 阻斷劑，可能讓心率和血壓反彈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping an α₂-agonist abruptly after regular use can make blood pressure rebound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用后突然停用 α₂ 激动剂，可能让血压反弹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用後突然停用 α₂ 促效劑，可能讓血壓反彈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping the clonidine-type drug suddenly while on a beta-blocker can spike blood pressure to dangerous levels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用 β 受体阻滞剂期间突然停用可乐定类药物，可能让血压飙升到危险水平。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用 β 阻斷劑期間突然停用可樂定類藥物，可能讓血壓飆升到危險水準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "存储大小"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "儲存空間大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store solutions in clearly marked, child-proof containers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将溶液存放在标识清楚、儿童无法打开的容器中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將溶液存放在標識清楚、兒童無法打開的容器中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in the app on this device, and in any device or iCloud backup your settings make of it. Anyone who can unlock the device can read it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "存储在本设备的应用内，以及你的设置为它所做的任何设备备份或 iCloud 备份中。任何能解锁这台设备的人都能读到它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "儲存在本裝置的 App 內，以及你的設定為它所做的任何裝置備份或 iCloud 備份中。任何能解鎖這台裝置的人都能讀到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strain" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "负荷"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "負荷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strain sums a noradrenergic cardiovascular term drawing on a depletable vasoconstriction pool, plus an opioid respiratory term. It deliberately follows concentration rather than the felt gap, so it stays elevated after the effect itself has faded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“负荷”由两项相加：一项取用可耗竭血管收缩池的去甲肾上腺素心血管项，以及一项阿片类呼吸抑制项。它刻意跟随浓度而非主观差距，因此在效应本身消退后仍会维持在高位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「負荷」由兩項相加：一項取用可耗竭血管收縮池的正腎上腺素心血管項，以及一項鴉片類呼吸抑制項。它刻意跟隨濃度而非主觀差距，因此在效應本身消退後仍會維持在高位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strength" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浓度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strength dots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强度圆点"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強度圓點"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong" : {
      "comment" : "Dose band",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强烈"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強烈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong and fast: a repeat exposure soon after has much less effect. Resets within a few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又强又快：不久之后再次接触，效果会弱得多。几天内恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又強又快：不久之後再次接觸，效果會弱得多。幾天內恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong encryption" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强加密"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強加密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stronger doesn't mean more dangerous — it's just how tightly the drug grips that one target in the lab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更强并不代表更危险——它只是表示在实验室中药物与该靶点结合的紧密程度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更強並不代表更危險——它只是表示在實驗室中藥物與該靶點結合的緊密程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strongly dopaminergic (SERT-sparing)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强多巴胺能（对 SERT 作用很弱）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強多巴胺能（對 SERT 作用很弱）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
