            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因為反跳就再服，會強化這個循環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking more to put off the crash moves the crash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了推迟崩溃而多服，只会把崩溃往后推。"
