    "TCAs usually blunt MDMA rather than boosting it, which leads people to take more; the bigger concern is added strain on heart rate and blood pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TCA 通常会削弱而不是增强 MDMA，这会让人服用更多；更大的问题是对心率和血压的额外负担。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TCA 通常會削弱而不是增強 MDMA，這會讓人服用更多；更大的問題是對心率和血壓的額外負擔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
