          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testosterone (suppression)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睾酮（抑制）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睪固酮（抑制）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testosterone aromatizes to estradiol, so E2 often rises on T. Piru plots your measured points — the conversion is person-specific, not modeled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睾酮会芳香化为雌二醇，所以用 T 期间 E2 常会上升。Piru 绘制你的实测点——这种转化因人而异，未被建模。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睪固酮會芳香化為雌二醇，所以用 T 期間 E2 常會上升。Piru 繪製你的實測點——這種轉化因人而異，未被建模。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testosterone ester curves are fit from label and primary-literature half-lives — there is no community PK simulator for them, so the band stays wide until your labs pin it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睾酮酯曲线由说明书和原始文献中的半衰期拟合而来——它们没有社区 PK 模拟器，所以在你的化验把它钉住之前，误差带会一直很宽。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睪固酮酯曲線由說明書和原始文獻中的半衰期擬合而來——它們沒有社群 PK 模擬器，所以在你的化驗把它釘住之前，誤差帶會一直很寬。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testosterone raises red-cell production, so hematocrit is monitored on T (largest rise in the first year). These are your measured points, plotted, not a prediction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睾酮会提高红细胞生成，所以用 T 期间要监测血细胞比容（第一年升幅最大）。这些是你实测点的绘图，不是预测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睪固酮會提高紅血球生成，所以用 T 期間要監測血球容積比（第一年升幅最大）。這些是你實測點的繪圖，不是預測。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text detected from the label. Check the name, strength and formulation before saving — a scan can't verify what is inside the box. Not medical advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从标签上识别出的文字。保存前请核对名称、规格和剂型——扫描无法验证盒子里面装的是什么。非医疗建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從標籤上識別出的文字。儲存前請核對名稱、規格和劑型——掃描無法驗證盒子裡面裝的是什麼。非醫療建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text from PsychonautWiki and FreeOD Wiki, as edited and merged in Piru." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文本，经 Piru 编辑并合并。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "來自 PsychonautWiki 和 FreeOD Wiki 的文字，經 Piru 編輯並合併。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text HOME to 741741" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送 HOME 至 741741"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "傳送 HOME 至 741741"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That preset already exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该预设已存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該預設已存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That total is in the heavy range of the sources. Overheating, confusion or rigid muscles need emergency help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个总量已处于各来源所列的大剂量范围。过热、意识混乱或肌肉僵直需要紧急救助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個總量已處於各來源所列的大劑量範圍。過熱、意識混亂或肌肉僵直需要緊急救助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's a high cumulative dose. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是较高的累积剂量。%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是較高的累積劑量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the most one session can carry. Remove one to add another." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这已经是一个场次能带的上限了。要再加一个，先移除一个。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這已經是一個場次能帶的上限了。要再加一個，先移除一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount that counts as a full supply for the bar. Set to 0 to hide the bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为进度条满量基准的数量。设为 0 可隐藏进度条。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作為進度條滿量基準的數量。設為 0 可隱藏進度條。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Apple Health sample nearest this time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最接近此时间的 Apple 健康样本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最接近此時間的 Apple 健康樣本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The calculation, step by step" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逐步拆解计算过程"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逐步拆解計算過程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The comedown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "药效下降期"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藥效下降期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The comedown here is over-compensation plus a depletion debt — not dopamine falling below baseline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处的药效下降期是代偿过度加上耗竭亏空——并非多巴胺跌破基线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此處的藥效下降期是代償過度加上耗竭虧空——並非多巴胺跌破基線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The concentration unit these values use. Lower numbers always mean the drug works at smaller amounts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些数值所用的浓度单位。数字越小，表示药物在更低的量下就能起作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些數值所用的濃度單位。數字越小，表示藥物在更低的量下就能起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cues alone can produce the opposite" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光是信号就能引出反向效果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光是訊號就能引出反向效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DAT:NET:SERT potency ratios are taken from one published assay, chosen by coverage and confidence, never mixed across labs. Only ratios measured in the same experiment are physically comparable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DAT:NET:SERT 的效价比取自同一篇已发表的实验，依覆盖度与可信度择优，绝不跨实验室混用。只有在同一实验中测得的比值才具有物理可比性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DAT:NET:SERT 的效價比取自同一篇已發表的實驗，依覆蓋度與可信度擇優，絕不跨實驗室混用。只有在同一實驗中測得的比值才具有物理可比性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The desmethyl metabolite shifts clomipramine's strongly serotonergic action toward noradrenaline, so the two don't act quite alike — the balance moves as the metabolite accumulates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去甲基代谢物将氯丙咪嗪强烈的血清素能作用向去甲肾上腺素方向转移，因此两者的作用并不完全相同——随着代谢物蓄积，平衡发生变化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去甲基代謝物將氯丙咪嗪強烈的血清素能作用向正腎上腺素方向轉移，因此兩者的作用並不完全相同——隨著代謝物蓄積，平衡發生變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Endocrine Society / WPATH SOC8 monitoring range for adults on masculinizing testosterone, drawn as reference lines. The range from your clinician or laboratory report takes precedence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内分泌学会 / WPATH SOC8 针对接受男性化睾酮治疗的成人的监测范围，绘制为参考线。以你的临床医生或化验报告给出的范围为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "內分泌學會 / WPATH SOC8 針對接受男性化睪固酮治療的成人的監測範圍，繪製為參考線。以你的臨床醫生或化驗報告給出的範圍為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine can simulate these as part of a plan, but they need a calibrated substance in the same plan to anchor the curve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎可以在方案中模拟这些物质，但同一方案中需要有一种已校准的物质来锚定曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎可以在方案中模擬這些物質，但同一方案中需要有一種已校準的物質來錨定曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact amount you have now. Changing it is logged as a correction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你当前的确切数量。修改后会记录为一次校正。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你目前的確切數量。修改後會記錄為一次校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The existing iCloud backup was removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已删除已有的 iCloud 备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已刪除已有的 iCloud 備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The existing iCloud backup will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有的 iCloud 备份将被永久删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有的 iCloud 備份將被永久刪除。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fast gap is the rush. Because the fast signal catches up within minutes, that gap is effectively proportional to how quickly dopamine rose. The slow gap is the high while it stays positive; once the slow expectation overshoots the falling dopamine, the same term turns into part of the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速差距就是快感冲击。由于快速信号在数分钟内即可追平，该差距实际上与多巴胺上升的速度成正比。缓慢差距在为正时即是高峰体验；一旦缓慢预期超过了正在下落的多巴胺，同一项便转为药效下降期的一部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速差距就是快感衝擊。由於快速訊號在數分鐘內即可追平，該差距實際上與多巴胺上升的速度成正比。緩慢差距在為正時即是高峰體驗；一旦緩慢預期超過了正在下落的多巴胺，同一項便轉為藥效下降期的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has an empty value for a required field: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件的必需字段为空值：%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案的必要欄位為空值：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has an unexpected value at: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件在此处包含意外的值：%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案在此處包含非預期的值：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is empty. Nothing was saved into it, so export again and wait for the save to finish before importing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件是空的。没有任何内容保存进去，请重新导出，等保存完成后再导入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案是空的。沒有任何內容儲存進去，請重新匯出，等儲存完成後再匯入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is missing a required field: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件缺少必需字段：%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案缺少必要欄位：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn't valid JSON." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件不是有效的 JSON。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案不是有效的 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first label that applies is shown. When none does, the dock shows “—”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示第一个适用的标签；都不适用时显示“——”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顯示第一個適用的標籤；都不適用時顯示「——」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first prompt arrives at least %lld minutes after the dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一条提示至少落在服用后 %lld 分钟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一條提示至少落在服用後 %lld 分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fog is reported to clear over hours. If it doesn't, get it looked at." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "据报告，昏沉感会在数小时内散去。如果没有，就去检查一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "據報告，昏沉感會在數小時內散去。如果沒有，就去檢查一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four readouts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "四项读数"
