    "Times are measured from your latest dose, so logging another moves them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间是从你最近一次剂量算起的，所以再记录一次就会把它们往后推。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時間是從你最近一次劑量算起的，所以再記錄一次就會把它們往後推。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timing cues at onset, come-up, and peak so you can anchor what you feel to the timeline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在起效、上升期和高峰期时给出时间提示，让你把感受对应到时间线上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在起效、上升期和高峰期時給出時間提示，讓你把感受對應到時間線上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
