        }
      }
    },
    "Totals include scheduled meds, as-needed doses, and everything else — the safety net doesn't care why you took it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "总量包括计划用药、按需用药和其他所有——安全网不在乎你为什么服用。"
