          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個數字沒有包含的部分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to avoid" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应避免的事"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "應避免的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you feel is a gap" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你感受到的是差距"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你感受到的是差距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you feel tracks a gap inside your dopamine system — the distance between the dopamine you have and the steady level your brain expects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受反映的是多巴胺系统内部的一段落差——现有多巴胺水平与大脑所预期的稳定水平之间的距离。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受反映的是多巴胺系統內部的一段落差——現有多巴胺水平與大腦所預期的穩定水平之間的距離。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you noticed, in a shared vocabulary — so a later you can search for the moment the geometry started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用共同词汇记下你注意到的——将来的你可以搜索几何图形出现的那一刻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用共同詞彙記下你注意到的——將來的你可以搜尋幾何圖形出現的那一刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your \"did it work?\" answers line up with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的“起效了吗？”答案和什么对得上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的「起效了嗎？」答案和什麼對得上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your body makes from this dose. Not a measured level." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体从这次剂量中生成的物质。并非实测数值。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體從這次劑量中生成的物質。並非實測數值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your ratings line up with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的评分和什么对得上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的評分和什麼對得上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's happening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在发生什么"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在發生什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a drug is taken repeatedly in the same place, with the same ritual, the body learns to pre-compensate — it starts pushing back before the dose even arrives. That conditioned response is a real part of tolerance: you feel less, partly because your system saw the cues and braced for it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一个地方、按同一套习惯反复用药，身体会学着提前代偿——还没等剂量生效就开始做出反向调整。这种条件反应确实是耐受的一部分：你感觉减弱了，有一部分原因正是你的系统看到了那些信号，提前做好了准备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一個地方、按同一套習慣反覆用藥，身體會學著提前代償——還沒等劑量生效就開始做出反向調整。這種條件反應確實是耐受的一部分：你感覺減弱了，有一部分原因正是你的系統看到了那些訊號，提前做好了準備。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When and how much you log" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在何时、记录了多少"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在何時、記錄了多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When dose and effect aren't proportional" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剂量与效应不成正比时"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當劑量與效應不成正比時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When dose and exposure aren't proportional" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剂量与暴露不成正比时"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當劑量與暴露不成正比時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Piru encrypts your journal and saves it to your private iCloud Drive each time you leave the app. The key is stored only in your iCloud Keychain, so it's end-to-end encrypted — **neither Apple nor Piru can read it** — and it restores on your other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，每次你离开 App 时，Piru 都会加密你的日记并保存到你的私人 iCloud 云盘。密钥只存储在你的 iCloud 钥匙串中，因此是端到端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都无法读取**——并且会在登录同一 Apple 账户的其他设备上自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每次你離開 App 時，Piru 都會加密你的日記並儲存到你的私人 iCloud 雲碟。金鑰只儲存在你的 iCloud 鑰匙圈中，因此是端對端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都無法讀取**——並且會在登入同一 Apple 帳號的其他裝置上自動還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When several sources report the same fact — a dose, a duration — Piru shows the one nearest the top. Drag to set which you trust most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当多个来源报告同一事实（如剂量、时长）时，Piru 会显示最靠上的那个。拖动以设置你最信任的来源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當多個來源報告同一事實（如劑量、時長）時，Piru 會顯示最靠上的那個。拖動以設定你最信任的來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you stop, that push-back is briefly left unopposed — which is why withdrawal or a comedown often feels like the mirror of the drug's effects (a stimulant's flatness, an opioid's aches)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一停，这股反向的推力会有一阵子没了对手——所以戒断或者下头往往像药效的镜像（兴奋剂之后的提不起劲、阿片之后的浑身酸痛）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一停，這股反向的推力會有一陣子沒了對手——所以戒斷或者下頭往往像藥效的鏡像（興奮劑之後的提不起勁、鴉片之後的渾身痠痛）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a regular dose settles, from your own cadence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你自己的节奏，规律剂量最终稳定在何处"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你自己的節奏，規律劑量最終穩定在何處"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a repeated dose settles, and when" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重复用药最终稳定在何处，以及需要多久"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重複用藥最終穩定在何處，以及需要多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where each regularly dosed substance settles, based on your log's cadence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据你的记录节奏，每种规律服用的物质将稳定在何处"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根據你的記錄節奏，每種規律服用的物質將穩定在何處"
