        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的資料已還原。請強制結束並重新開啟 Piru 以載入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your days, side by side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的日子，并排摆着"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的日子，並排擺著"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your dose is first expressed as a multiple of that substance's reference dose — the amount the model was tuned around. It then moves through a three-stage absorption chain into a central compartment that clears by first-order elimination, using an absorption rate (ka) and an elimination rate (ke) derived from the measured half-life and time to peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的剂量首先会换算为该物质参考剂量的倍数——即模型调校时所围绕的用量。随后它经过三级吸收链进入中央室，并以一级消除方式清除；其中吸收速率（ka）与消除速率（ke）由实测半衰期和达峰时间推导而来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的劑量首先會換算為該物質參考劑量的倍數——即模型調校時所圍繞的用量。隨後它經過三級吸收鏈進入中央室，並以一級消除方式清除；其中吸收速率（ka）與消除速率（ke）由實測半衰期和達峰時間推導而來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your dose timeline will appear here once you log something." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录第一笔用药后，剂量时间线会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄第一筆用藥後，劑量時間線會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your entries, your meds and dose trends, as one document" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的条目、你的药物和剂量趋势，汇为一份文档"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的項目、你的藥物和劑量趨勢，彙為一份文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your History" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的历史"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的歷史"
