        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你自己的參考線。Piru 不設目標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own read of how affected you are is unreliable while dissociated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "处于解离状态时，你对自己受影响程度的判断并不可靠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "處於解離狀態時，你對自己受影響程度的判斷並不可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recorded amounts, timing, and self-reported effects — at a glance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你记录的用量、时间和自我报告的效果——一目了然。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你記錄的用量、時間和自我報告的效果——一目瞭然。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your remaining amount stands out once it drops below this. Set to 0 to disable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剩余量低于此值时会突出显示。设为 0 可停用。"
